  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes the lake’s surface or shores while it remains underground. When the water monster wakes, water ripples appear deep underground, then gushes of water rush out of the black soil above and form dozens of huge water pillars tens of feet high through smoky warm jade field.",
