      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yi Nan Men tells Yi Yu that his investigative killer move found an ancient water monster under smoky warm jade field, and that they are luring the slumbering monster to wake and rampage rather than acting openly.",
      "chapters": [
        1533
      ],
