    },
    {
      "text": "After the monster surfaces with huge frog legs and vast gushing water, Hou Yao states that smoky warm jade field has an underground frost heart lake and that an ancient water monster was inside it. Shang Qing Qing asks Tie Mian Shen to lead while the rank six immortals assist, to stop the monster from destroying the field.",
